    <Placemark>
      <name>Darfield Senior Citizens Club</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Join in fellowship. Keep people in the community, giving them an interest in what goes on about them. Affordable and within people's reach. Activities include speakers, bus trips and car outings, games afternoon (Housie) and annual mid-winter dinner<br>Contact person: Mervyn Feutz<br>phone number: 03 318-8277<br>email: <br>website (or Fb): <br>Address: Darfield Recreation Centre, North Terrace, Darfield 7510<br>Subject: Arts, crafts and hobbies, Indoor games, Community groups, Senior citizens' clubs<br>Last update: 11/27/2018<br>X latitude: -43.4876886<br>Y longitude: 172.1095257]]></description>
