      <description><![CDATA[Description: A local group formed to promote the interests of the Dexter cattle breed in the upper half of the South Island. Most of those involved are members of the Dexter Cattle Society New Zealand. Activities include meetings, field trips and advice to new owners<br>Contact person: Marion Mangnall<br>phone number: 03 318-7237<br>email: jimari@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.rarebreeds.co.nz/mainland.html<br>Address: 1195 Coaltrack Road, Greendale, RD1, Christchurch 7671<br>Subject: Community groups, Trade and professional associations, Dexter cattle<br>Last update: 12/12/2018<br>X latitude: -43.601785<br>Y longitude: 172.113334]]></description>
