      <description><![CDATA[Description: To bring healing and restoration to families and individuals. To build strong support networks within our community, by providing counselling, childcare, youth activities, mentoring, lifeskills, afterschool care, friendship and fellowship. Everyone welcome<br>Contact person: Rev. Greg Morris<br>phone number: 03 312-4499<br>email: oxfordbaptistchurch@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.oxfordbaptist.co.nz<br>Address: 166 High Street, Oxford 7430<br>Subject: Community groups, Church groups, Baptists<br>Last update: 12/18/2018<br>X latitude: -43.2930268<br>Y longitude: 172.1975984]]></description>
