    <Placemark>
      <name>Lincoln Playcentre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Lincoln Playcentre encourages learning through fun and play for children from 0-6 years. We recognise that children reach their full potential when parents and whanau understand their development and take part in the learning process. With the help of fully trained co-ordinators and parent help we are able to offer minimum ratios of 1 adult to 5 children. We provide safe, interactive and stimulating sessions where children are free to choose their activities and develop in their own time<br>Contact person: <br>phone number: 325-6158<br>email: lincolnplaycentre@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/PlaycentreCanplay  http://www.canterburyplaycentre.org.nz/<br>Address: 109 North Belt, Lincoln 7608<br>Subject: Community groups, Educational groups, Education, Preschool, Play schools, Home and family<br>Last update: 12/6/2018<br>X latitude: -43.6379674<br>Y longitude: 172.4834523]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>Lincoln Playcentre encourages learning through fun and play for children from 0-6 years. We recognise that children reach their full potential when parents and whanau understand their development and take part in the learning process. With the help of fully trained co-ordinators and parent help we are able to offer minimum ratios of 1 adult to 5 children. We provide safe, interactive and stimulating sessions where children are free to choose their activities and develop in their own time</value>
        </Data>
