    <Placemark>
      <name>Day by Day Christian Ministries</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Filipino church. Day By Day Christian Ministries (also known as DBD) is an evangelical Christian mega-church organisation headquartered in Makati City, Philippines and the its main worship centre at the Folk Arts Theatre, Cultural Center of the Philippines, Manila. Though DBD is currently headquartered in the Philippines, it started in Saudi Arabia. Churches were built in North America in the 1990s and in Japan in the early 2000s. The priority of the church is expansion in the Middle East, where the majority of the people are Muslim. The church also is expanding in non-Muslim countries such as in Singapore and New Zealand.<br>Contact person: Rey Pagaduan<br>phone number: 550-1590<br>email: daybydaychristchurch@yahoo.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.daybyday.com.ph http://www.redemptionofdance.org/Kaloob.html<br>Address: 12 Wycola Avenue, Hei Hei, Christchurch 8042<br>Subject: Community groups, Church groups, Independent churches, Ethnic groups, Filipinos, Cultural groups, Dance, Music, Dance -- Philippines, Music -- Philippines<br>Last update: 11/27/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5358032<br>Y longitude: 172.5218639]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>Filipino church. Day By Day Christian Ministries (also known as DBD) is an evangelical Christian mega-church organisation headquartered in Makati City, Philippines and the its main worship centre at the Folk Arts Theatre, Cultural Center of the Philippines, Manila. Though DBD is currently headquartered in the Philippines, it started in Saudi Arabia. Churches were built in North America in the 1990s and in Japan in the early 2000s. The priority of the church is expansion in the Middle East, where the majority of the people are Muslim. The church also is expanding in non-Muslim countries such as in Singapore and New Zealand.</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="Contact person">
          <value>Rey Pagaduan</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="phone number">
          <value>550-1590</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="email">
          <value>daybydaychristchurch@yahoo.co.nz</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="website (or Fb)">
          <value>http://www.daybyday.com.ph http://www.redemptionofdance.org/Kaloob.html</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="Address">
          <value>12 Wycola Avenue, Hei Hei, Christchurch 8042</value>
        </Data>
