    <Placemark>
      <name>Hornby Community Care Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Provides an opportunity shop with clothing/household items for the whole family at very affordable prices. Rooms available to hire for meetings, seminars and community groups etc.at reasonable rates. Citizens Advice Bureau on site. JP Services and Free Legal Advice available. Phone for times. Community workers luncheon meeting held monthly - great networking opportunity.<br>Contact person: Linda Turner<br>phone number: 349-9793<br>email: hornbycommunitycentre@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): <br>Address: 8 Goulding Avenue, Hornby, Christchurch 8042<br>Subject: Jigsaw puzzles, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Books and reading, Welfare, Parenting, Secondhand clothing, Creative writing<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5445661<br>Y longitude: 172.5223203]]></description>
