    <Placemark>
      <name>Hornby Heartlands Service Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description:  Heartlands is an interagency collaboration initiative about improving access to Government services.  We offer a range of both Government and community organisations face to face services.  Age Concern, Kingdom Resources Budgeting, Community Law Canterbury, Family Planning Clinic, Green Prescription Clinic, Justice of Peace, Life Unlimited - Free Hearing Clinic, OtautahiPegasus Health, Workbridge, Youth Justice, Age Concern, NZ Red Cross, City Mission Budgeting.  Able to connect you to other local social services. At Heartlands we provide a range accessible information and free to the publi.  Come and browse our display stands to find that info that you may need or ask for help and support<br>Contact person: June Foster-Campbell<br>phone number: 961-9248<br>email: hornby@heartlandservices.govt.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.heartlandservices.govt.nz/locations/hornby.html<br>Address: 25 Shands Road, Hornby, Christchurch 8042<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Government departments, Community groups, Cultural groups, Educational groups, Homelessness, Homeless persons -- Budgeting services, Homeless persons -- Housing, Homeless persons -- Medical care, Homeless persons -- Services for, Languages<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5457186<br>Y longitude: 172.5246126]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value> Heartlands is an interagency collaboration initiative about improving access to Government services.  We offer a range of both Government and community organisations face to face services.  Age Concern, Kingdom Resources Budgeting, Community Law Canterbury, Family Planning Clinic, Green Prescription Clinic, Justice of Peace, Life Unlimited - Free Hearing Clinic, OtautahiPegasus Health, Workbridge, Youth Justice, Age Concern, NZ Red Cross, City Mission Budgeting.  Able to connect you to other local social services. At Heartlands we provide a range accessible information and free to the publi.  Come and browse our display stands to find that info that you may need or ask for help and support</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="Contact person">
          <value>June Foster-Campbell</value>
        </Data>
