    <Placemark>
      <name>Catholic Parish of Hornby-Darfield</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Our vision is that we seek to be a community of people who are: Committed to holiness; Welcoming, friendly and hospitable; Joyful in our celebrations, both liturgically and socially  Open to change, and willing to learn, grow and collaborate. Served by the rich diversity of our talent and ethnic composition, with much opportunity for people to offer their gifts in service to God and to each other.  Particularly aware of the needs of families, youth, the sick and the elderly. Striving to be Christ-centred while reaching out to others. Faithful to the teachings of the Church. Parish Primary School (St Bernadette's), Children's Liturgies, FUSE Youth Group, Marriage Preparation, Young Adults' Faith Formation, Samoan Youth, Passionist Family Groups, Samoan Community Group, Tongan Comunity Group, Friendship Group, Zimbabwaen Community Group, Prison Ministry, St Vincent de Paul Group, Serenity Faith & Light Group, Adult Education, Confirmation Preparation, Rosary Group<br>Contact person: Paulo Filoiali-i<br>phone number: 342-9763<br>email: hornbyparish@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.chch.catholic.org.nz<br>Address: St. Bernadette's, 76 Hei Hei Road, Hornby<br>Subject: Community groups, Church groups, Catholic Church, Samoans<br>Last update: 11/20/2018<br>X latitude: -43.533666<br>Y longitude: 172.525225]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
