    <Placemark>
      <name>Hornby Day Care Centre for the Elderly</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: We provide a community activity programme for older people living in our community. Our focus is providing an opportunity for social interaction and offering a stimulating activity programme to those who may be socially isolated. We have a registered nurse on our team and an experienced and caring team of staff. All members enjoy a cooked lunch and morning and afternoon tea. <br>Contact person: Kiri McKenzie<br>phone number: 349-3129<br>email: hornbydaycare@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): <br>Address: 93 Carmen Road, Hei Hei, Christchurch 8042<br>Subject: Community groups, Health and welfare, Adult day care centres, Older people<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5356277<br>Y longitude: 172.5290279]]></description>
