    <Placemark>
      <name>No.17 Squadron(City of Christchurch) Air Training Corps, New Zealand Cadet Forces</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: A voluntary disciplined training activity for young people aged 13 to 16 years. Activities include youth leadership, tramping, abseiling, first aid, aviation studies, flying and other outdoor activities. We are one of the biggest and best units in New Zealand and if you join us you are bound to have a good time and learn lots of new skills<br>Contact person: Shane Cole, NZCF<br>phone number: 343-9555<br>email: enquiries@17squadronatc.com<br>website (or Fb): http:////www.facebook.com/17SquadronATC/  http://www.17squadronatc.com/<br>Address: 41 Corsair Drive, Hornby, Christchurch 8042<br>Subject: Arts, crafts and hobbies, Community groups, Air force cadets, Youth -- Societies and clubs, Community studies, Educational groups, Personal development, Sports and recreation<br>Last update: 12/13/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5494549<br>Y longitude: 172.5469145]]></description>
