          <value>A group of amateurs and professionals dedicated to the study and enjoyment of New Zealand birds. It provides material on bird research in its publications and functions as a facility for monitoring resources. Regular field trips, monthly meetings and other activities are undertaken. Several schemes are run to study various aspects of birds, from the Clarence River to Waitaki River and inland to the Main Divide.</value>
