    <Placemark>
      <name>GirlGuiding New Zealand</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: To enable girls and young women to reach their full potential and make a difference in the world. GirlGuiding is New Zealandâ€™s largest girl-only organisation, offering girls and young women opportunities to enjoy a wide range of activities and outdoor adventures so they reach their potential and can make a difference in the world.At GirlGuiding New Zealand, girls are always counting down to their next adventure. Catering to girls age 5-17, contact us to discuss your options. GirlGuiding NZ is a girl led organisation which means girls take a key role in decision making. We also have all kinds of roles for adult volunteers as role models for girls and young women<br>Contact person: Tegan Dunne<br>phone number: 0800 22 22 92<br>email: info@girlguidingnz.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://facebook.com/GirlGuidingNZ  http://www.twitter.com/GirlGuidingNZ  http://www.girlguidingnz.org.nz/<br>Address: 5 Sir William Pickering Drive, Burnside, Christchurch 8053<br>Subject: Arts, crafts and hobbies, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Youth -- Societies and clubs, Girl Guides, Home and family, Personal development, Sports and recreation<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.4929329<br>Y longitude: 172.5612055]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>To enable girls and young women to reach their full potential and make a difference in the world. GirlGuiding is New Zealandâ€™s largest girl-only organisation, offering girls and young women opportunities to enjoy a wide range of activities and outdoor adventures so they reach their potential and can make a difference in the world.At GirlGuiding New Zealand, girls are always counting down to their next adventure. Catering to girls age 5-17, contact us to discuss your options. GirlGuiding NZ is a girl led organisation which means girls take a key role in decision making. We also have all kinds of roles for adult volunteers as role models for girls and young women</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="Contact person">
          <value>Tegan Dunne</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="phone number">
          <value>0800 22 22 92</value>
        </Data>
