    <Placemark>
      <name>Halswell Community Project</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: 1) promote Halswell  Halswell clubs  groups activities and businesses to Halswell residents and residents of surrounding areas 2) Develop a strong sense of community in Halswell and make Halswell a lively and interesting place to live and work. 3) Work with the idea of sustainability and think about how we can build resilience and resourcefulness locally in terms of economic development  food production  and reducing our environmental footprint as a community.<br>Contact person: Kate Cleverly<br>phone number: 027-370-0344<br>email: halswell.comm@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/halswell.community  http://www.halswellcommunity.net.nz<br>Address: 6 Balcairn Street, Halswell, Christchurch 8025<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Citizens' associations, Community groups<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.574542<br>Y longitude: 172.5665799]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>1) promote Halswell  Halswell clubs  groups activities and businesses to Halswell residents and residents of surrounding areas 2) Develop a strong sense of community in Halswell and make Halswell a lively and interesting place to live and work. 3) Work with the idea of sustainability and think about how we can build resilience and resourcefulness locally in terms of economic development  food production  and reducing our environmental footprint as a community.</value>
