      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>To promote the playing of bagpipes and drums: competitions, solo piping and drumming. Pipers for social occasions, funerals, mini pipe band for balls, conventions, and concerts. Annual Scottish Golf Day at Clearwater Golf Course 15th May.  Annual competition run by band at Canterbury University first Saturday in December.  Band travels to Glasgow Scotland each year to compete in World Championships.  Band is currently 9th in the World. </value>
