      <description><![CDATA[Description: To promote fellowship amongst people from Scandinavian countries or people with a Scandinavian connection. The club is a contact point for meeting other Scandinavians and celebrate Scandinavian traditions like 'Juleklip', 'Juletrefest', 'Lucia', 'Fastelavn', 'St.Hans', 'Midsommer' etc.<br>Contact person: Christina Clarkson<br>phone number: 03 318-8109<br>email: bjorkangen@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/Scandinavian-Club-Christchurch-Inc-New-Zealand-180256845319651/<br>Address: 409 Harewood Road, Harewood, Christchurch 8051<br>Subject: Community groups, Ethnic groups, Scandinavians<br>Last update: 1/8/2019<br>X latitude: -43.4845507<br>Y longitude: 172.5786446]]></description>
