    <Placemark>
      <name>Rowley Resource Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: The Rowley Resource Centre has been in the Rowley Avenue - Hoon Hay community for over 25 years. We operate as a part-time community-based centre that focuses on enabling community development and growth through the provision of services, facilities, courses and community-led groups for the improvement of lives in the community. The center houses many sevices and events. Please see the website, or the center itself for more information. <br>Contact person: Donna McAleer<br>phone number: 03 960-1776<br>email: manager@rowleyresourcecentre.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/rowleyresourcecentrechch/   http://www.rowleyresourcecentre.org.nz/<br>Address: 89 Rowley Avenue, Hoon Hay, Christchurch 8025<br>Subject: Stone carving, Handicraft, Greeting cards, Citizen and consumer, Budgets, Personal, Drop-in centres, Rental housing, Community groups, Men -- Societies and clubs, Educational groups, Literacy programmes, Play groups, Health and welfare, Income maintenance programmes, Cooking, Reo MaÌ„ori, Personal development, Self-esteem, Immigrants -- Services for<br>Last update: 12/20/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5649266<br>Y longitude: 172.5877993]]></description>
