    <Placemark>
      <name>Generation Zero</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Generation Zero is a nationwide, youth-led organisation working to cut carbon pollution through smarter transport, liveable cities and independence from fossil fuels. We've written the blueprint for a Zero Carbon Act, a law that will put NZ on track to carbon neutrality by 2050, and keep the Government - and all future governments - accountable on their climate change promises. We're working to build a mandate for cross-party support for the Zero Carbon Act - see the website<br>Contact person: Rosalee Jenkin<br>phone number: 027-368-5459<br>email: rosalee@generationzero.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.zerocarbonact.nz<br>Address: 7 Hollyford Avenue, Bryndwr, Christchurch 8053<br>Subject: Environmental management, Community groups, Transportation<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.505988<br>Y longitude: 172.588028]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value><![CDATA[Generation Zero is a nationwide, youth-led organisation working to cut carbon pollution through smarter transport, liveable cities and independence from fossil fuels. We've written the blueprint for a Zero Carbon Act, a law that will put NZ on track to carbon neutrality by 2050, and keep the Government - and all future governments - accountable on their climate change promises. We're working to build a mandate for cross-party support for the Zero Carbon Act - see the website]]></value>
