    <Placemark>
      <name>Hoon Hay Village</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Hoon Hay Village is a unique facility, providing specialist mental health care, physical disability and intellectual care for a group of residents under the 65 year age group. The staff includes the Registered Nurse / Manager who has considerable mental health background and supporting staff of experienced carers trained in mental health areas. A full time cccupational therapist works to provide an environment in which each individual is encouraged to engage in the daily organisation of their life, with assistance by staff<br>Contact person: <br>phone number: 335-0297<br>email: hoonhay@goldenhealthcare.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://mherc.org.nz/directory/all-listings-alphabetical/hoon-hay-village<br>Address: 16 Anvers Place, Christchurch 8025<br>Subject: Housing, Community groups, Trusts and trustees, Homelessness, Homeless persons -- Housing, Homeless persons -- Mental health services, Homeless persons -- Services for, Medical support groups, Mental health, Mentally ill -- Services for<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.558737<br>Y longitude: 172.5903449]]></description>
