      <name>Bryndwr Community Group</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Organising group to establish a Bryndwr Community Association whose first focus is to ensure that the Community Housing Redevelopment Mechanism proposed for Bryndwr is developed in full consultation with locals and is sustainable and best practice in all ways.  Other possible projects include a Time Bank for Bryndwr, supporting the Bryndwr Community Gardens, and supporting better communication among residents and groups based in Bryndwr.<br>Contact person: Marney Ainsworth<br>phone number: 021-284-7122<br>email: bryndwrcommunity@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/bryndwr/<br>Address: Bryndwr<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Citizens' associations, Community groups<br>Last update: 11/13/2018<br>X latitude: -43.50545<br>Y longitude: 172.591065]]></description>
