    <Placemark>
      <name>Fendalton Community Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Venue for hire. Hall used by badminton, dance, cultural, yoga, gymnastics, exercise, church groups and Fendalton School. Other groups welcome. Fendalton Open Air School has permanent use of hall Monday-Friday, 9am-3.30pm, during school term but other groups may be able to book space during these hours at future date. Activities Room is the home of Fendalton Out of School Programme, Monday-Friday, 3-6pm and during school holiday periods, maybe available for hire outside these hours during the day and evening<br>Contact person: <br>phone number: 941-8888<br>email: info@ccc.govt.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://ccc.govt.nz/culture-and-community/venues-for-hire/fendalton-community-centre/<br>Address: 170 Clyde Road, Christchurch 8053<br>Subject: Community centres, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Sports and recreation<br>Last update: 11/28/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5153565<br>Y longitude: 172.5911952]]></description>
