      <name>WAIYouth</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: WaiYouth is all about young people taking action on things young people care about. Events, volunteering and giving young people a voice in our local community. WaiYouth meets together every two weeks to discuss ideas and plan events for the district while also developing their own leadership, organisational and personal skills.<br>Contact person: Sam Redman<br>phone number: 0800-965-544 , 021-567-544<br>email: waiyouth18@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/WAIYouth/  https://www.waimakariri.govt.nz/waiyouth<br>Address: 215 High Street, Rangiora 7400<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Community groups, Youth -- Societies and clubs, Youth -- Services for, Personal development<br>Last update: 1/10/2019<br>X latitude: -43.3039272<br>Y longitude: 172.5924062]]></description>
