      <description><![CDATA[Description: An organisation for both rural and urban women, non-profit making, non-political, with no religious denomination affiliation. The motto is For Home & Country. Members have wide interests and keep up with current issues in the wider community. Five local Women's Institutes make up the District Federation<br>Contact person: Adrienne James<br>phone number: 356-2676<br>email: adriennejamesnz@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.wi.org.nz/<br>Address: 7 Resolution Place, Bryndwr, Christchurch 8053<br>Subject: Community groups, Women -- Societies and clubs, New Zealand Federation of Women's Institutes, New Zealand Federation of Women's Institutes<br>Last update: 11/14/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5036496<br>Y longitude: 172.597639]]></description>
