    <Placemark>
      <name>Zen Buddhism. Diamond Sangha Christchurch</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: The Christchurch Diamond Sangha is a Zen Buddhist group led by Arthur Wells who is a Roshi (senior teacher) in the lay tradition founded by Robert Aitken in Hawaii.  We meet weekly and hold retreats several times a year.  Beginner instruction is given and all are welcome.  We run on a donation basis and only charge a fee for our costs when we run retreats.  For further information, venue and times, please contact Arthur Wells or Shona Pierce<br>Contact person: Arthur Wells<br>phone number: 348-4656<br>email: arthurw@orcon.net.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.zendo.org.nz/<br>Address: 18 Rata Street, Riccarton, Christchurch 8041<br>Subject: Community groups, Buddhism<br>Last update: 1/10/2019<br>X latitude: -43.52816<br>Y longitude: 172.600123]]></description>
