      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>The Christchurch Diamond Sangha is a Zen Buddhist group led by Arthur Wells who is a Roshi (senior teacher) in the lay tradition founded by Robert Aitken in Hawaii.  We meet weekly and hold retreats several times a year.  Beginner instruction is given and all are welcome.  We run on a donation basis and only charge a fee for our costs when we run retreats.  For further information, venue and times, please contact Arthur Wells or Shona Pierce</value>
