    <Placemark>
      <name>Christchurch Methodist Mission</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Offers a range of services for individuals, families, groups, schools and communities; pre-school eduation; older persons' services and social housing. A range of home and school based services for parents, carers, children and young people. Fostering Changes Programme for carers; ParentWorks programme for parents with children in care; InSync programme for children in care; Budgeting and advocacy; Men on a Mission mens group; Wise-Up and other children's lifeskills programmes; Aratupu Preschool; community support to schools; Wesleycare Resthome, hospital and independent living accommodtion and support for older persons; community housing.  <br>Contact person: Sue van Deurs<br>phone number: 375-1470<br>email: intake@mmsi.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/MethodistMissionChristchurch http://www.mmsi.org.nz/<br>Address: 231 Matsons Avenue, Papanui, Christchurch 8053<br>Subject: Budgets, Personal, Food banks, Community groups, Food relief, Educational groups, Health and welfare, Homelessness, Homeless persons -- Budgeting services, Homeless persons -- Services for, Welfare, Home and family<br>Last update: 11/22/2018<br>X latitude: -43.49618642<br>Y longitude: 172.6029775]]></description>
