    <Placemark>
      <name>U3A Christchurch North West</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: U3A, the University of the Third Age, is a voluntary organisation providing informal education for people who have reached retirement age, giving opportunities for those no longer limited by work or family commitments to hear interesting speakers and perhaps join others for special interest topics such as book discussions, art, music or film appreciation, food and other topics that members choose.<br>Contact person: GILLIAN HARRIS<br>phone number: 33,554,834<br>email: u3achristchurchnorthwwest@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://christchurchnwu3a.co.nz<br>Address: 108 Jeffreys Road, Fendalton, Christchurch 8052<br>Subject: Retirement, Community groups, Social groups, Educational groups, Older people -- Education<br>Last update: 1/9/2019<br>X latitude: -43.51122197<br>Y longitude: 172.603065]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>U3A, the University of the Third Age, is a voluntary organisation providing informal education for people who have reached retirement age, giving opportunities for those no longer limited by work or family commitments to hear interesting speakers and perhaps join others for special interest topics such as book discussions, art, music or film appreciation, food and other topics that members choose.</value>
