    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Baha'i Faith]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: The Baha'i Faith is a World Religion based on a belief in the Oneness of God, the Oneness of Religion (all the world's major religions are a part of this Oneness), and the Oneness of Humankind - a set of beliefs designed to bring about the long awaited unification of all Humanity. Enquiries welcomed<br>Contact person: John Spurdle<br>phone number: 348-8501<br>email: lsa-christchurch@bahai.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/chchbahai/ , http://www.bahai.org.nz/<br>Address: 31 Domain Terrace, Spreydon, Christchurch 8024<br>Subject: Community groups, Bahai Faith<br>Last update: 11/8/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5575825<br>Y longitude: 172.6031963]]></description>
