      <description><![CDATA[Description: Hobgoblin provides a framework to draw together a range of individuals, groups and organisations in a dialogue out of which might emerge a united social force, though with different dialects and tendencies, that is armed with a clear project to smash neo-liberal global capitalism and pursue a practical alternative<br>Contact person: <br>phone number: 352-7251<br>email: info@hobgoblin.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.hobgoblin.org.nz/<br>Address: 126B Sawyers Arms Road, Northcote, Christchurch 8052<br>Subject: Community development, Free trade, Government information, Human rights, Nonproft organizations, Protectionism, Restorative justice, Community groups, World politics, International relations, Economics, Privatization<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.4855371<br>Y longitude: 172.6040483]]></description>
