    <Placemark>
      <name>PEETO - the Multi Cultural Learning Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: A registered and accredited private training establishment, PEETO is a truly multicultural learning centre providing ESOL training services to learners from more than 60 nationalities since 1991. PEETO provides learners with a stimulating environment within which they may explore and develop learning pathways, which will assist them in realising their full potential. PEETO will recognise, while being sensitive, to the personal and cultural needs of each student.<br>Contact person: Elise Olivier<br>phone number: 343-2890<br>email: info@peeto.ac.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.peeto.ac.nz/<br>Address: 20 Twigger Street, Addington, Christchurch 8024<br>Subject: Immigrants, Refugees, Community groups, Educational groups, Languages, Computers<br>Last update: 12/19/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5454259<br>Y longitude: 172.605091]]></description>
