    <Placemark>
      <name>Manchester Unity Friendly Society. Loyal Canterbury Lodge</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: People helping people. A growing and profitable organisation that provides financial products and fraternal services for the benefit of its members. Financial products: medical insurance (Affordablehealthcare).  Fraternal services: holiday accommodation, UFS Pharmacy, self development in public speaking and meeting procedure. Meeting people, and various social activities include tramping, travel, sports activities, Friday Night Club, and a ladies' fellowship group<br>Contact person: Paul Hopewell<br>phone number: 980-3687<br>email: paul.hopewell.nz@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.manchesterunity.org.nz/<br>Address: Philatelic Society, 67 Mandeville Street, Riccarton, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Community groups, Lodges (Associations, institutions, etc.), Manchester Unity Friendly Society<br>Last update: 12/12/2018<br>X latitude: -43.532482<br>Y longitude: 172.606502]]></description>
