    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Christchurch Girls' High School Old Girls' Association]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: The Christchurch High School Old Girls' Association was founded in 1900.The aim of the Association is to foster and keep alive amongst past and present pupils and staff, a remembrance of the school and Acland House and to take an active interest in their welfare. It endorses the school philosophy, which believes that academic achievement should be encouraged, love of learning should be nurtured, and young women should be empowered to make the best use of their opportunities and talents<br>Contact person: Di Kennedy<br>phone number: 351-7004<br>email: oga@cghs.school.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.cghs.school.nz/our-community/old-girls/ http://onstream.cghs.school.nz/course/view.php?id=2016<br>Address: 10 Matai St, Riccarton, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Community groups, Christchurch Girls' High School -- Alumni and alumnae, Old girls' associations, Educational groups<br>Last update: 11/22/2018<br>X latitude: -43.524843<br>Y longitude: 172.61016]]></description>
