    <Placemark>
      <name>Scouts New Zealand</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Scouts caters for both boys and girls and covers the following programmes: Keas, school years 1 to 3; Cubs, school years 3 to 6; Scouts, youth ages 10-14; Venturers, young people ages 14-18; Rovers, young people ages 18-26. The programme caters for both boys and girls. We also cater for Special Needs and Lone Scouts. Please phone for locations<br>Contact person: <br>phone number: 0800-726-887, 982-7836<br>email: usi@scouts.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/USIRegionScoutsNZ/  http://www.scouts.org.nz/<br>Address: 213 Hoon Hay Road, Hoon Hay, Christchurch 8025<br>Subject: Community groups, Youth -- Societies and clubs, Scouting (Youth activity), Scouts (Youth organization members), Youth with disabilities -- Recreation<br>Last update: 1/8/2019<br>X latitude: -43.56647136<br>Y longitude: 172.6104855]]></description>
