      <description><![CDATA[Description: Christchurch Resettlement Services provides social work, including support around mental health and family violence, health promotion, bilingual community workers, health information providers, earthquake support coordinators, partnership community workers, counsellors,and a range of activities for people from refugee and migrant backgrounds. Interpreters are provided, and all services are free of charge<br>Contact person: Shirley Wright<br>phone number: 335-0311 <br>email: admin@crs.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://facebook.com/Christchurch.resettlement.services http://www.crs.org.nz<br>Address: Addington Shops, 283-291 Lincoln Rd, Addington, Christchurch 8024<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Refugees, Community groups, Youth -- Services for, Cultural groups, Homelessness, Homeless persons -- Services for, Physical fitness, Sports and recreation, Swimming, Physical fitness, Walking, Immigrants -- Services for, Refugees -- Services for<br>Last update: 11/22/2018<br>X latitude: -43.543635<br>Y longitude: 172.6105824]]></description>
