      <description><![CDATA[Description: To promote a better understanding of Islam. We are all the off-spring of Prophet Adam and life has been given us as a trust.  The way to success in this life and the next is to follow the commands of God as told by his last Prophet and Messenger Muhammad (Peace be upon him). The Muslim Association of Canterbury (Al-Noor Mosque) in Christchurch is probably the most southern and furthest established mosque in the world. Muslims have been known to be in Christchurch from the beginning of this century<br>Contact person: Shagaf Khan<br>phone number: 348-3930<br>email: admin@macnz.org<br>website (or Fb): http://www.macnz.org<br>Address: 109 Deans Avenue, Riccarton, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Community groups, Islam, Church groups, Muslims<br>Last update: 12/12/2018<br>X latitude: -43.53286131<br>Y longitude: 172.6119873]]></description>
