    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Christchurch Boys' Choir]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: From its founding under Clifton Cook in 1985 to the present day, our treble voice choir has evolved to a very high standard. We have sung with the Christchurch Symphony Orchestra, the Christchurch City Choir, the Christchurch Liedertafel and Canterbury Opera. We have toured around New Zealand, Australia and Japan. We are not affiliated with any church or school so are able to perform alone, with other choirs, or at special events. We continue to challenge and extend each boy by arranging exciting performance opportunities throughout the year<br>Contact person: Chairperson<br>phone number: 021-773-390<br>email: admin@christchurchboyschoir.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/ChristchurchBoysChoir<br>Address: 125 Heaton Street, Strowan, Christchurch 8052<br>Subject: Community groups, Cultural groups, Music, Boys' choirs, Choirs (Music)<br>Last update: 11/21/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5098093<br>Y longitude: 172.6162483]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>From its founding under Clifton Cook in 1985 to the present day, our treble voice choir has evolved to a very high standard. We have sung with the Christchurch Symphony Orchestra, the Christchurch City Choir, the Christchurch Liedertafel and Canterbury Opera. We have toured around New Zealand, Australia and Japan. We are not affiliated with any church or school so are able to perform alone, with other choirs, or at special events. We continue to challenge and extend each boy by arranging exciting performance opportunities throughout the year</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="Contact person">
          <value>Chairperson</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="phone number">
