    <Placemark>
      <name>Manuka Cottage. Addington Community House</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Manuka Cottage is a Community Development Hub. Together as a community we create a network of information, resources, sharing and daily support through a variety of interests. Pop in for a hot drink, access information and resources, join in a group or participate in our many activities. All are welcome. Walking Groups - Walkie Talkies â€“Addy-venturers, Card Players, Coffee n Conversation, Manuka Art (limited places) Womenâ€™s Day Bits n Bobs, Bring and Buy; Coffee n Conversation, Craft Group, Shared Lunch, Addington TimeBank Manuka Trading Post, Community Lunch, Manuka Fruit & Vege Co-op, Cafe Culture, Manuka Scribes, Addington TimeBank, Addington Times, Mothers, Community Program, SPACE 1st time mums programme (contact 027-416-2656) <br>Contact person: Cherylan Davies<br>phone number: 020-408-64947  338-1613<br>email: manukacottage@accd.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http:///www.facebook.com/manukacottagenz/<br>Address: 7 Church Square, Addington, Christchurch 8024<br>Subject: Automobile trailers, Gardening, Community gardens, Handicraft, Drop-in centres, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Poetry, Play groups, Health and welfare, After-school programmes, Massage, Homelessness, Homeless persons -- Food, Homeless persons -- Services for, Physical fitness, Older people -- Services for, Home and family, Sports and recreation, Sporting goods, Physical fitness<br>Last update: 12/12/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5443034<br>Y longitude: 172.6174321]]></description>
