    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Rangi Ruru Girls' School]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Rangi Ruru Girls' School is an independent (private) boarding and day school for girls in Years 7 to 13.The school has an excellent academic record, producing confident, resourceful, independent young women, with a strong sense of values and community. The school also has a gymnasium, tennis/netball courts,  artificial hockey turf and 25m outdoor heated pool on its campus for hire. The Merivale Lane Theatre (opened in 2015) seats 126, Drama Theatre seats 111 as well as Onsite historical St Andrew's at Rangi Ruru church (capacity 600) available for weddings and concerts. School facilities available for hire in evenings and weekends and term breaks (conditions apply). Use of school technology and IT support available by agreement<br>Contact person: Eddie Cropley<br>phone number: 983-3703<br>email: e.cropley@rangiruru.school.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/RangiRuru/  http://www.rangiruru.school.nz<br>Address: <br>Subject: Arts, crafts and hobbies, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Community studies, Cultural groups, Educational groups, High schools, Intermediate schools, Private schools, Sports and recreation, Presbyterian primary schools, Presbyterian high schools<br>Last update: 12/19/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5189098<br>Y longitude: 172.6180807]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value><![CDATA[Rangi Ruru Girls' School is an independent (private) boarding and day school for girls in Years 7 to 13.The school has an excellent academic record, producing confident, resourceful, independent young women, with a strong sense of values and community. The school also has a gymnasium, tennis/netball courts,  artificial hockey turf and 25m outdoor heated pool on its campus for hire. The Merivale Lane Theatre (opened in 2015) seats 126, Drama Theatre seats 111 as well as Onsite historical St Andrew's at Rangi Ruru church (capacity 600) available for weddings and concerts. School facilities available for hire in evenings and weekends and term breaks (conditions apply). Use of school technology and IT support available by agreement]]></value>
        </Data>
