    <Placemark>
      <name>Hiyokodonburi Japanese Playgroup</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Playgroup for 0-5 year olds with some connection to Japan. This playgroup is conducted in the Japanese language, and focuses on the culture, customs and traditions of Japan. A qualified Japanese preschool teacher attends each group session. Each session has a different theme, which gives the children a variety of things to do, make and experience. Outside trips also a feature<br>Contact person: Noriko Yee<br>phone number: 339-4252<br>email: hiyokodon@hotmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://hiyokodon.jimdo.com<br>Address: 231 Barrington Street, Spreydon, Christchurch 8024<br>Subject: Community groups, Ethnic groups, Cultural groups, Educational groups, Japanese children -- Education (Preschool), Play groups, Japanese language<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5582768<br>Y longitude: 172.6196412]]></description>
