    <Placemark>
      <name>Adidam - Christchurch</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: We warmly invite you to spend an evening with Avatar Adi Da Samraj and his spiritual teachings. Adi Da says "there is a state of Being that is completely, unequivocally, permanently, infinitely Happy and Free - a state that cannot be lost under any conditions, in this world or after death. Such a state is not imaginary. It is the underlying Truth of existence. I am that State and I have come to reveal it to everyone". Please also visit adidam.org to find out more about Adi Da's life and work with his students. Please give us a call if you would like more information or would like to come and participate in one of our fortnightly DVD evenings of spiritual teachings and discussions. <br>Contact person: Tracy Abbot<br>phone number: 981-7858<br>email: tabbot123@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.adidam.org/<br>Address: 34 Sydney Street  Sydenham Christchurch 8023<br>Subject: Community groups, Da Free John, 1939-, Meditation, Spiritual life<br>Last update: 10/31/2018<br>X latitude: -43.551204<br>Y longitude: 172.620342]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value><![CDATA[We warmly invite you to spend an evening with Avatar Adi Da Samraj and his spiritual teachings. Adi Da says "there is a state of Being that is completely, unequivocally, permanently, infinitely Happy and Free - a state that cannot be lost under any conditions, in this world or after death. Such a state is not imaginary. It is the underlying Truth of existence. I am that State and I have come to reveal it to everyone". Please also visit adidam.org to find out more about Adi Da's life and work with his students. Please give us a call if you would like more information or would like to come and participate in one of our fortnightly DVD evenings of spiritual teachings and discussions. ]]></value>
        </Data>
