      <description><![CDATA[Description: Playcentre is about fun, quality early childhood education and learning alongside our children.  We believe that parents/whanau are the first and best educators of their children.  We also offer a Babies CanPlay session on a Friday which is a dedicated play session for under 2 year olds<br>Contact person: <br>phone number: ,352-9752,377-9516,<br>email: redwoodpc@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/PlaycentreCanplay  http://www.canterburyplaycentre.org.nz/<br>Address: 40 Dunedin Street, Redwood,  Christchurch 8051<br>Subject: Community groups, Educational groups, Education, Preschool, Play schools, Home and family<br>Last update: 12/20/2018<br>X latitude: -43.476854<br>Y longitude: 172.6224115]]></description>
