    <Placemark>
      <name>Linwood Neighbourhood Committee</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Official residents' group for the area bounded by Fitzgerald Avenue, Armagh Street, Tuam Street and Linwood Avenue. We liaise with local residents and the Hagley-Ferrymead Community Board and Christchurch City Council. We are currently involved in several local projects and would welcome any new members, e.g. our millennium project is the establishment of a new public park in our area. We are interested in researching the history of Linwood and preserving our heritage<br>Contact person: Glenn McRostie<br>phone number: 352-5133<br>email: <br>website (or Fb): <br>Address: 65 Regency Crescent, Christchurch, 8051<br>Subject: Citizens' associations, Community groups<br>Last update: 12/6/2018<br>X latitude: -43.4821084<br>Y longitude: 172.6234539]]></description>
