    <Placemark>
      <name>Diabetes Christchurch</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: To provide information, encouragement and support for a person and their  family members with diabetes, to educate the public on the importance of early detection and treatment, to support research and training. Supports all people with diabetes including their friends and family. Some shop supplies include: Blood glucose meters, cook books and dietary information, dextros, medical grade shoes and socks specifically for foot problems, travel bags, sugar free sweets, lancets etc. Shop and more info now on line at www.diabeteschristchurch.co.nz. Visit ground floor shop, 550 Hagley Avenue, Christchurch<br>Contact person: Lynne Taylor<br>phone number: 378-6266<br>email: info.diabeteschch@cdhb.health.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/DiabetesChristchurchInc  http://www.diabeteschristchurch.co.nz<br>Address: 550 Hagley Avenue, Christchurch<br>Subject: Community groups, Educational groups, Health and welfare, Health, Medical support groups, Diabetes<br>Last update: 11/28/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5353924<br>Y longitude: 172.625929]]></description>
