    <Placemark>
      <name>Cashmere High School Foundation</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: The Cashmere High School Foundation is a New Zealand registered Charitable Trust established in 2009 to connect the Alumni and Friends of Cashmere High School, foster their continued interest in their school, and to facilitate opportunities to benefit the past, present and future students of Cashmere High School<br>Contact person: Jess Forbes<br>phone number: 021-370-465<br>email: administration@cashmerehighfoundation.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/cashmerehighfoundation http://www.cashmerehighfoundation.org.nz<br>Address: Cashmere High School, 172 Rose St, Somerfield, Christchurch 8024<br>Subject: Community groups, Cashmere High School -- Alumni and alumnae, Old students' associations, Educational groups, High schools<br>Last update: 11/15/2018<br>X latitude: -43.565596<br>Y longitude: 172.626265]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>The Cashmere High School Foundation is a New Zealand registered Charitable Trust established in 2009 to connect the Alumni and Friends of Cashmere High School, foster their continued interest in their school, and to facilitate opportunities to benefit the past, present and future students of Cashmere High School</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="Contact person">
