      <description><![CDATA[Description: We offer the best, most informative and most personal guided tours of Christchurch. These are guided walking tours of our inner city for visitors. We also provide tour guides for visiting tour coaches and cruise ships. We specialise in small groups of up to 8 people, but have a facility for larger groups on a pre-booked basis<br>Contact person: Warwick Hill<br>phone number: 0800-423-783<br>email: walkguideschristchurch@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.walkchristchurch.nz<br>Address: 11 Rolleston Avenue, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8013<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Tourism, Community groups, Cultural groups<br>Last update: 11/29/2018<br>X latitude: -43.53096254<br>Y longitude: 172.6275341]]></description>
