    <Placemark>
      <name>Arts Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Come shop, eat, discover, wonder and relax in this stunningly unique heritage precinct. Boutique shopping,  beautiful public spaces, galleries, museums,  jewellery,  fudge,  stationery,  a cafe and artisan food outlets can all be found within this stunning unique heritage precinct.<br>Contact person: Jo Gilbert<br>phone number: 03 366 0989<br>email: info@artscentre.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/artscentrechch/ , http://www.artscentre.org.nz/ , http://twitter.com/ChchArtsCentre<br>Address: 2 Worcester Boulevard, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8013<br>Subject: Art, Citizen and consumer, Historic buildings, Community groups, Cultural groups, Drama, Music, Educational groups<br>Last update: 11/7/2018<br>X latitude: -43.531129<br>Y longitude: 172.6280725]]></description>
