          <value>Community Garden in Sydenham. Established 1999. Learn about gardening practices, composting, recycling and provide food for the community. All welcome to help in the garden or donate / koha for plants and produce.  Research students invited and school programmes available to enhance the curriculum. Expressions of interest to join the board of trustees always welcome - please supply a brief biography</value>
