      <description><![CDATA[Description: Methodist church with choir. Committed to social justice and community building. Linked with other inner city churches. Church demolished following Feb. 2011 earthquake.ew Aldersgate Centre now being built on 309 Durham Street site. Parish now worshipping in the Hall at the Knox Centre, 28 Bealey Avenue, Christchurch. For service times and other Parish activities see the website<br>Contact person: Sue Chappell<br>phone number: 348-9260<br>email: office.chcwestmethodist@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/DurhamStreetMethodistChurch/  https://durhamstreetmethodist.wordpress.com/ http://www.methodist.org.nz/find_us/central_south_island/parish_information/durham_st/index <br>Address: 28 Bealey Avenue, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8013<br>Subject: Community groups, Church groups, Methodist Church, Health and welfare<br>Last update: 11/28/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5211372<br>Y longitude: 172.6286656]]></description>
