      <name>Zonta Club of Christchurch South</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: A service organization of executive women in business and the professions. Excellent fellowship and inspiring monthly speakers. Advancing the status of women worldwide. Funds awards and scholarships for women. Supports self help and development programmes locally and internationally. Determines and implements strategies to eradicate violence against women and children. Advances the status of women through action and advocacy<br>Contact person: Dr. Margaret Currie<br>phone number: 021-135-7576<br>email: christchurchsouth@zonta.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/ZontaChristchurchSouth/  http://www.zonta.org.nz/<br>Address: 129 Cambridge Terrace, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8013<br>Subject: Community groups, Service organizations, Women -- Societies and clubs, Zonta clubs<br>Last update: 1/10/2019<br>X latitude: -43.5312144<br>Y longitude: 172.6324389]]></description>
