    <Placemark>
      <name>Living Springs Camp and Convention Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Living Springs is a conference and outdoor education centre located only 20 minutes from Christchurch in the stunning setting of Lyttelton Harbour.  We welcome and host a wide range of groups, including schools, community, churches and corporate. Accommodation, fully catered kitchen plus self catering options, meeting rooms, auditorium, indoor heated swimming pool, camping facilities and cabins, 420ha rural property with native bush to explore plus many outdoor adventure activities. <br>Contact person: Michelle Sintes<br>phone number: 329-9788<br>email: admin@livingsprings.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/pages/Living-Springs/400136450630?ref=hl  http://www.livingsprings.co.nz<br>Address: 218 Bamfords Road, Allandale 8971<br>Subject: Camp sites, facilities, etc., Community groups, Church groups, Educational groups, Health and welfare, Home and family, Sports and recreation<br>Last update: 12/6/2018<br>X latitude: -43.6532053<br>Y longitude: 172.6352965]]></description>
