    <Placemark>
      <name>Canterbury Playcentre Association</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Playcentre : "Whanau tupu ngatahi - families growing together" Playcentre is a licensed early childhood education organisation where we provide sessions for children to learn and explore through play from birth to six years and provide support and learning opportunities for whanau/parents/caregivers.   Parents/whanau are valued as the first and most important educators of their children.  Playcentre is highly active and a popular choice in the ECE sector.  There are currently 46 Playcentres in the Canterbury region. Please visit the Canterbury Playcentre Association's website or facebook page or contact the Canterbury Playcentre Association to locate a centre near you and confirm their days/times of operation and for more information on the Playcentre Shop on site at 17 Buchan Street, Sydenham, Christchurch<br>Contact person: Regional Administrator<br>phone number: 377-2540<br>email: uppersouth.admin@playcentre.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/PlaycentreCanplay / https://www.facebook.com/theplaycentreshop/timeline http://www.canterburyplaycentre.org.nz/ http://www.playcentre.org.nz/ http://www.playcentreshop.co.nz/<br>Address: 17 Buchan Street, Sydenham, Christchurch 8023<br>Subject: Community groups, Educational groups, Education, Preschool, Play schools, Home and family<br>Last update: 11/15/2018<br>X latitude: -43.54728<br>Y longitude: 172.6378461]]></description>
