    <Placemark>
      <name>City Church Christchurch</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Alive in the heart of Christchurch, City is a church without walls, that believes everything is possible through Jesus. Come and encounter God in a fresh and existing way this Sunday. All welcome. Auditorium, meeting room and full kitchen; whiteboard, overhead projectors, multi-media projector and large screen, two computer inputs and video with television, sound system; disabled access; no alcohol allowed<br>Contact person: Garth Chin Poy<br>phone number: 379-7979<br>email: office@citychurchchristchurch.co.nz<br>website (or Fb):  https://www.citychurchchristchurch.co.nz/ministries  https://www.citychurchchristchurch.co.nz/events  http://www.facebook.com/CityChurchChristchurch/  http://www.citychurchchristchurch.co.nz/<br>Address: 346 Manchester Street, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8013<br>Subject: Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Church groups, Apostolic Church of New Zealand, Church work with children, Church work with men, Church work with women, Youth -- Services for, Play groups -- Music, Church work with older people, Church work with youth, Personal development<br>Last update: 11/27/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5221091<br>Y longitude: 172.6410132]]></description>
