      <name>Otautahi Aikido</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: To practice the Japanese martial art of Aikido in a safe and fun environment. Aikido is dynamic, non-fighting and non-competitive; it emphasises good body movement, use of timing and the control of an attacker's balance and centre to throw or immobilise them<br>Contact person: Liam O'Donoghue<br>phone number: 021-727690<br>email: chchaikido@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/otautahi.aiki  http://www.aikido.gen.nz<br>Address: 52 Coleridge Street, Sydenham, Christchurch 8023<br>Subject: Community groups, Personal development, Sports and recreation, Martial arts, Aikido, Martial arts weapons<br>Last update: 12/18/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5460019<br>Y longitude: 172.6422378]]></description>
