    <Placemark>
      <name>Workplace Support. Upper South Island</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Employee Assistance Staff Training, seminar facilitation, work place chaplaincy service, caring for people in the work place by preventative and crisis counselling. We provide a range of support services that are designed and customised to meet the needs of our clients and their employees including on-site staff support, counselling, critical incident stress management, professional supervision, education and training and consultancy and human resource services<br>Contact person: Brent Andrews<br>phone number: 0800-443-445<br>email: office@workplacesupport.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.workplacesupport.co.nz/<br>Address: 286 Oxford Terrace, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Community groups, Church groups, Church and social problems, Chaplains, Industrial, Counselling, Occupational training, Employee assistance programmes, Employees -- Services for<br>Last update: 1/10/2019<br>X latitude: -43.5273873<br>Y longitude: 172.6428869]]></description>
