    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Canterbury Women's Club]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Canterbury Women's Club was established 102 years ago to be a meeting place for women, providing a place for women to meet for friendship and support. The club is affiliated with similar groups New Zealand wide. Music, Bolivia (card game), bridge, icon painting, reel women films, CWC book club lectures, conversation for migrants. Guest speakers, catered lunches. Venue for hire<br>Contact person: Lynette Hardie Wills<br>phone number: 366-8957<br>email: lynettehardiewills@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.canterburywomen.org<br>Address: 190 Worcester Street, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Arts, crafts and hobbies, Gardening, Indoor games, Card games, Contract bridge, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Women -- Societies and clubs, Music<br>Last update: 11/15/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5312403<br>Y longitude: 172.6443016]]></description>
