    <Placemark>
      <name>Nigerian Canterbury Association</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: To promote and foster harmonious relationships amongst various sections of the Nigerian and wider African community in Canterbury; act as a voice for the Nigerian community in Canterbury on matters affecting them and their relationship with the community at large; and educate New Zealanders about the Nigerian culture, values and way of life by promoting, preserving and practicing the relevant aspects of Nigerian culture<br>Contact person: Muhammad Yakubu<br>phone number: 374-6889<br>email: nigeriancanterburyassociation@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/pages/Nigerian-Canterbury-Association-of-New-Zealand-Inc/283081193531 http://www.nigeriancanterbury.co.nz<br>Address: 225 Geraldine Street, Edgeware, Christchurch 8013<br>Subject: Community groups, Ethnic groups, Nigerians, Cultural groups<br>Last update: 12/13/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5098004<br>Y longitude: 172.6471543]]></description>
