      <name>Community Energy Action Charitable Trust. Energy Advice Service</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Free and independent energy efficiency information. If you have a question about energy efficiency,  high power bills,  condensation, appliances, keeping warm, draught stopping etc in your house  you can get information and advice from one of our energy advisers. This free service funded by Orion,  can be accessed over the phone or by email. Contact us today if you want advice on how to make your home warmer, drier,  healthier and more energy efficient.<br>Contact person: Michael Begg<br>phone number: 0800-438-9276<br>email: info@cea.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/CommunityEnergyAction http://twitter.com/ComEnergyAction http://www.cea.co.nz<br>Address: 301 Tuam Street, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Energy conservation, Housing, Community groups, Educational groups, Health and welfare, Dwellings -- Heating and ventilation, Electric power consumption<br>Last update: 11/27/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5350393<br>Y longitude: 172.6474876]]></description>
