    <Placemark>
      <name>Comcare CharitableTrust</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Comcare is a Charitable Trust established to provide support services for people living in Canterbury who experience mental health or addiction issues. Services include a range of housing support; support to participate in sport, recreation or leisure activity; a supported employment service; community support; a telephone peer support service; and specialist assistance to move on from inpatient and residential services<br>Contact person: Comcare Trust staff<br>phone number: 377-7020<br>email: enquiries@comcare.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.comcare.org.nz<br>Address: 251 Lichfield Street, Christchurch Central, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Housing, Community groups, Trusts and trustees, Homelessness, Homeless persons -- Employment, Homeless persons -- Housing, Homeless persons -- Mental health services, Homeless persons -- Services for, Shelters for the homeless, Medical support groups, Mental health, Mentally ill -- Services for, Home and family, Recreation<br>Last update: 11/27/2018<br>X latitude: -43.534<br>Y longitude: 172.6497883]]></description>
