          <value>Comcare is a Charitable Trust established to provide support services for people living in Canterbury who experience mental health or addiction issues. Services include a range of housing support; support to participate in sport, recreation or leisure activity; a supported employment service; community support; a telephone peer support service; and specialist assistance to move on from inpatient and residential services</value>
