      <description><![CDATA[Description: Te Whare Roopu o Oterepo works towards an empowering, supportive, non-judgmental environment for people within the Waltham community and surrounding areas. We believe in collective decision making, in creating a safe and caring community, a place where all cultural differences and values are respected. The cottage offers a great range of support and activities for people in the Waltham area<br>Contact person: Cheryl Batwell<br>phone number: 942-2173<br>email: tewhare@walthamcottage.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.walthamcottage.com/<br>Address: 201 Hastings Street East, Waltham, Christchurch 8023<br>Subject: Community centres, Drop-in centres, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Social groups, Senior citizens' clubs, Play groups, Bread, Employment re-entry, Life skills, Tai chi<br>Last update: 1/10/2019<br>X latitude: -43.5492085<br>Y longitude: 172.6511781]]></description>
