    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Canterbury Men's Centre]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Supports men and boys in Canterbury. Contact us if you want someone to help you sort your life out. We have social workers, counsellors and coaches on hand and tooled up to see that you get what you need to make the most out of your life. We are also known for our other projects such as men's sheds and the blokes book<br>Contact person: Donald Pettitt<br>phone number: 365-9000<br>email: counsellor@canmen.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/canterburymenscentre/ , http://www.canmen.org.nz/<br>Address: 357 Gloucester Street, Linwood, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Community groups, Men -- Societies and clubs, Health and welfare, Health, Men -- Mental health, Welfare, TaÌ„ne, Boys, Personal development<br>Last update: 11/14/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5295277<br>Y longitude: 172.6518099]]></description>
