      <name>CAMEO (Come And Meet Each Other)</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: A group for senior citizens in St Martins. Morning tea is provided (at no cost) and this is followed by a variety of games and activities or a guest speaker and music (provided by school children when possible.) The group is open to anyone who would like friendship and company for a couple of hours <br>Contact person: Judy Sutherland <br>phone number: 027-469-2599 <br>email: jimjudysuds@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): https://ageconcerncan.org.nz/listings/cameo-come-and-meet-each-other-senior-citizens-programme/<br>Address: 148 Wilsons Road South, St Martins, Christchurch 8022<br>Subject: Handicraft, Indoor games, Community groups, Social groups, Senior citizens' clubs, Music<br>Last update: 11/14/2018<br>X latitude: -43.55586<br>Y longitude: 172.65254]]></description>
