    <Placemark>
      <name>Crown Lodge</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Freemasonry is a fraternal organisation offering personal development, social activities and community involvement to men of good character over the age of 21. The Crown Lodge is lively and energetic with a fresh approach to the ancient traditions of Freemasonry, while our Scottish origins brings a slightly different flavour to our meetings. If you would like to join Freemasonry, contact us through our website<br>Contact person: Dai Eveleigh<br>phone number: 022-020-0750<br>email: Thecrownlodge@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.freemasonschristchurch.co.nz<br>Address: 7 Shirley Road, Mairehau, Christchurch 8013<br>Subject: Community groups, Lodges (Associations, institutions, etc.), Freemasonry<br>Last update: 11/27/2018<br>X latitude: -43.50795817<br>Y longitude: 172.6528788]]></description>
