          <value>Freemasonry is a fraternal organisation offering personal development, social activities and community involvement to men of good character over the age of 21. The Crown Lodge is lively and energetic with a fresh approach to the ancient traditions of Freemasonry, while our Scottish origins brings a slightly different flavour to our meetings. If you would like to join Freemasonry, contact us through our website</value>
