      <description><![CDATA[Description: To support young people with offending histories to make positive choices for the future. Mentoring programmes for young people aged 12-14 who are not engaged at school and / or offending. Refocus: early intervention programme for the whole family of young people aged 9-12 who have been assessed as 'likely' to end up in Youth Court. C2C Rangers - Aranui Services Academy. <br>Contact person: Bevan Seal (MNZM)<br>phone number: 349-4801<br>email: bevan.seal@cydp.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.cydp.org.nz<br>Address: 39 Nursery Road, Phillipstown, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Community groups, Youth -- Societies and clubs, Youth -- Services for, Health and welfare, Welfare, Social work with teenagers, Social work with youth, Home and family, Sports and recreation<br>Last update: 11/15/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5372204<br>Y longitude: 172.6567388]]></description>
