    <Placemark>
      <name>ENC Business Centre</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Enterprise North Canterbury (ENC) Business Centre is an innovative space designed to be a 'go to' place for the North Canterbury business community. The Business Centre offers a conference room equipped with the latest technology as well as two private meeting rooms and our free drop-in workspaces where you can tap into ultrafast Wi-Fi and work productively whilst on the move<br>Contact person: <br>phone number: 03 327-3135<br>email: businesscentre@enterprisenc.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): https://enc.checkfront.com/reserve/  http://www.northcanterbury.co.nz/training-events/ http://www.facebook.com/NCEDT  http://www.twitter.com/enterprisenc http://www.northcanterbury.co.nz<br>Address: 143 Williams Street, Kaiapoi 7630<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Halls, meeting rooms, etc., Community groups, Community studies, Educational groups, Occupational training, Personal development<br>Last update: 11/28/2018<br>X latitude: -43.3817536<br>Y longitude: 172.658521]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
