    <Placemark>
      <name>Burwood Day Care Centre for the Elderly</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Burwood Day Care provides a happy, homely environment with responsible and caring supervision. We provide a choice of activities, motivation and stimulation, companionship, physical, mental and spiritual wellbeing. Nutritious meals are provided and all cooked on the premises. Wide range of recreational activities suited towards the individual, with both group and individual activities. Lots of care and fun. We provide a pick-up and drop off service<br>Contact person: Joanne Fraser<br>phone number: 389-3738<br>email: club304@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): https://www.eldernet.co.nz/Facilities/Home_Help_and_Personal_Care_Assistance/Club_304__Burwood_Day_Care_Centre/Service/DisplayService/FaStID/2072<br>Address: 181 Linwood Avenue, Linwood, Christchurch 8011<br>Subject: Community groups, Health and welfare, Adult day care centres, Older people -- Services for<br>Last update: 11/14/2018<br>X latitude: -43.53138425<br>Y longitude: 172.6703976]]></description>
