    <Placemark>
      <name>Just Dirt Trust</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: We are a multi-faceted organisation seeking to bring people together in various projects such as gardening to build strong vibrant caring communities. We all need to learn to work together, for the common good of our neighbours. We seek to encourage the establishment of community gardens, in schools and churches etc. and are working towards creating gardens in former red zone areas<br>Contact person: Selwyn Eagle<br>phone number: 385-6894<br>email: justdirtnz@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/TheJustDirtTrust/  https://justdirt.weebly.com/<br>Address: 62 Birchfield Avenue, Dallington, Christchurch 8061<br>Subject: Arts, crafts and hobbies, Gardening, Community gardens, Community groups, Trusts and trustees<br>Last update: 12/5/2018<br>X latitude: -43.511052<br>Y longitude: 172.675267]]></description>
