    <Placemark>
      <name>Linwood Forum</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: To provide the opportunity to discuss issues in an open forum and to hear what the issues are for others. The value of the forum is that not only is it a way to meet others working in the community but it is a chance to debate things that are happening. It is not expected that there will be complete agreement on every issue but that at least the issue will be given a chance to be aired and perhaps some solutions sought. People who attend are not necessarily just from Linwood<br>Contact person: Jenny Townhend<br>phone number: 941-6620<br>email: shupayi.mpunga@ccc.govt.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.ccc.govt.nz/<br>Address: Board Room, Linwood Service Centre, 180 Smith Street, Christchurch, 8062<br>Subject: Community development, Community groups, Health and welfare<br>Last update: 12/6/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5376352<br>Y longitude: 172.6771426]]></description>
