    <Placemark>
      <name>Lyttelton Harbour Business Association</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: The Lyttelton Harbour Business Association is a dynamic organisation with a strategic marketing plan. The LHBA seeks to increase awareness and visibility of Lyttelton Harbour as a destination, develop new products and business opportunities, develop better distribution relationships, facilitate greater understanding of the local Christchurch market and its perception of Lyttelton, develop generic promotional tools thats will increase the profile of Lyttelton Harbour, represent the business community on local committees affecting business environment and create sustainable funding schemes for community and tourism products<br>Contact person: Rob de Thier<br>phone number: 027-631-5306<br>email: admin@lhba.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.lhba.co.nz<br>Address: 5 Norwich Quay, Lyttelton 8082<br>Subject: Community groups, Business -- Societies, etc.<br>Last update: 12/6/2018<br>X latitude: -43.604158<br>Y longitude: 172.7223064]]></description>
      <styleUrl>#icon-1899-0288D1</styleUrl>
      <ExtendedData>
        <Data name="Description">
          <value>The Lyttelton Harbour Business Association is a dynamic organisation with a strategic marketing plan. The LHBA seeks to increase awareness and visibility of Lyttelton Harbour as a destination, develop new products and business opportunities, develop better distribution relationships, facilitate greater understanding of the local Christchurch market and its perception of Lyttelton, develop generic promotional tools thats will increase the profile of Lyttelton Harbour, represent the business community on local committees affecting business environment and create sustainable funding schemes for community and tourism products</value>
        </Data>
        <Data name="Contact person">
          <value>Rob de Thier</value>
        </Data>
