    <Placemark>
      <name><![CDATA[Redcliffs Residents' Association]]></name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: General oversight of the area, advocating for improved facilities and services, representing the interests of residents and local businesses and organising community events. We publish a regular newsletter. The RRA represents the interests of residents with Christchurch City Council through Hagley-Ferrymead Community Board and submissions on relevant Resource Consent Applications. The RRA is an Incorporated Society.<br>Contact person: Dr. Pat McIntosh<br>phone number: 800234565 376-6133<br>email: redcliffs.ra@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.facebook.com/RedcliffsResidentsAssociation  http://www.redcliffs.org.nz<br>Address: 148-150 Main Road, Redcliffs, Christchurch 8081<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Citizens' associations, Community groups<br>Last update: 12/20/2018<br>X latitude: -43.5599076<br>Y longitude: 172.7362803]]></description>
