      <name>Sumner Playgroup</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: A playgroup that meets for children to play, parent time + support, coffee, and an awesome morning tea for the kids. We are happy for families all over Christchurch to come visit us. We are looking into doing a lot of fun things over the next few terms including beach visits during the summer, animals visiting us, and messy play. <br>Contact person: Nicole Renee McKinnon<br>phone number: 021-067-4034<br>email: sumnerplay@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): <br>Address: 37 Nayland Street, Sumner, Christchurch 8081<br>Subject: Community groups, Educational groups, Play groups, Home and family<br>Last update: 1/9/2019<br>X latitude: -43.5692061<br>Y longitude: 172.7588515]]></description>
