      <description><![CDATA[Description: For retired or semi-retired women, to encourage intellectual and cultural interests. It is non-political, non-sectarian, and does not engage in fundraising. It promotes friendship and liaises with other Friendship clubs in the southeast area, sharing information. Activities: monthly meetings with speakers and outings, <br>Contact person: Lee Latham<br>phone number: 326-6195<br>email: lathams@xtra.co.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://fnzi.nz/<br>Address: 42 Dryden Street, Sumner, Christchurch 8081<br>Subject: Community groups, Friendship clubs, Friendship clubs for women<br>Last update: 1/9/2019<br>X latitude: -43.5744643<br>Y longitude: 172.7629771]]></description>
