    <Placemark>
      <name>YMCA Wainui Park</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: Located on the shores of Akaroa Harbour and nestled in a beautiful valley, YMCA Wainui Park is a residential camp site, conference centre and a public camping ground. YMCA Wainui Park can provide a customized experience for your school, community group, sports team or corporate retreat. We have an extensive range of outdoor and water based activities available for your camp<br>Contact person: Michael Linton<br>phone number: 03 304-8460<br>email: michael.linton@ymcachch.org.nz<br>website (or Fb): http://www.ymcachch.org.nz/wainui<br>Address: 104 Wainui Valley Road, Wainui 7582<br>Subject: Camp sites, facilities, etc., Community groups, Cultural groups, Educational groups, Health and welfare, Home and family, Personal development, Sports and recreation<br>Last update: 1/10/2019<br>X latitude: -43.8121525<br>Y longitude: 172.8939024]]></description>
