      <name>Addington TimeBank </name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: We recognise that each person in our community has talents to share, and that the overall community is strengthened when neighbours help one another. For every hour that you help meet the needs of another member, you earn a time credit for the exchange. This time credit may then be redeemed for services from others<br>Contact person: Chrys Horn<br>phone number: 027-286-8653<br>email: addington.timebank@gmail.com<br>website (or Fb): http://www.addingtontimebanks.org http://www.facebook.com/groups/addingtontimebank/<br>Address: St Mary's Church, 21 Church Square, Addington, Christchurch 8024<br>Subject: Citizen and consumer, Barter, Community groups, Home and family<br>Last update: 10/31/2018<br>X latitude: -43.544856<br>Y longitude: 172.618270]]></description>
