    <Placemark>
      <name>Best Start Cashmere</name>
      <description><![CDATA[Description: BestStart Cashmere (formerly ABC Cashmere) is a family focused early learning centre located in the heart of the Cashmere/Beckenham loop. We pride ourselves on our strong community connections and meaningful relationships with whānau and tamariki to ensure that we provide the best possible care and education for every child. Full day/sessional education and childcare for years 0-5. <br>Contact person: <br>phone number: 332-8282<br>email: cashmere@best-start.org<br>website (or Fb): https://best-start.org/centres/beststart-cashmere?gclid=EAIaIQobChMIlK2urpSv3gIVQaSWCh13KwBkEAAYASAAEgIGZ_D_BwE<br>Address: 95 Colombo Street Cashmere Christchurch<br>Subject: Community groups , Cultural groups , Day care centres , Education, Preschool , Educational groups , Health and welfare , Home and family , Occupational training<br>Last update: 10/31/2018<br>X latitude: -43.560652<br>Y longitude: 172.636818]]></description>
